  "decision": null,
  "decision_conditions": [
    "Condition : 1 - The facing materials to be used on the swimming pool\r\n    extension shall not be otherwise than as shall have been\r\n    submitted to and approved by the Council before any work on\r\n    the site is commenced.",
    "Condition : 2 - Full details of the new gates on Millfield Lane shall not\r\n    be otherwise than as shall have been submitted to and\r\n    approved by the Council before any work on site is\r\n    commenced.",
    "Condition : 3 - No development shall take place until full details of hard\r\n    and soft landscaping and means of enclosure of all unbuilt,\r\n    open areas have been submitted to and approved by the\r\n    Council.",
    "Condition : 4 - All hard and soft landscaping works shall be carried out to\r\n    the end of the following planting season, with others of\r\n    similar size and species, unless the Council gives written\r\n    consent to any variation.\r\n    a reasonable standard in accordance with the approved\r\n    landscape details, prior to the occupation for the\r\n    permitted use of the development or any phase of the\r\n    development, whichever is the sooner. Any trees or areas of\r\n    planting which, within a period of 5 years from the\r\n    completion of the development die, are removed, or become\r\n    seriously damaged or diseased, shall be replaced as soon as\r\n    is reasonably possible and, in any case, by not later than",
    "Condition : 5 - & 02. To ensure that the Council may be satisfied with the\r\n    external appearance of the extension and of the gates.",
    "Condition : 6 - In order that the Council may give consideration to the\r\n    details of the proposed development.",
    "Condition : 7 - To ensure that the landscaping is carried out within a\r\n    reasonable period and to maintain a satisfactory standard\r\n    of visual amenity in the scheme."
  ],
